@startuml
title SD04-UC01: setRequestDates
hide footbox
autonumber

actor "Office Staff" as Staff
participant ":LoanRequestController" as Ctrl
participant ":LoanRequestService" as Svc
participant "currentRequestData\n:LoanRequestDTO" as DTO

Staff -> Ctrl : setRequestDates(collectionDate, returnDate)
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> Svc : setRequestDates(collectionDate, returnDate)
activate Svc
Svc -> DTO : setDates(collectionDate, returnDate)
activate DTO
deactivate DTO

note right of DTO
  Either date may be empty [0..1].
  An unknown date stays unset; no date is invented (OC-UC01-04).
end note
note right of DTO
X
end note

Svc --> Ctrl
deactivate Svc
Ctrl --> Staff
deactivate Ctrl
@enduml